# Title: Suspicious Uninstall of Windows Defender Feature via PowerShell
# ID: c443012c-7928-43bf-ac20-7eda5efe61ad
# Status: experimental
# Level: high
# Author: yxinmiracle
# Date: 2025-08-22
# Tags: attack.defense-impairment, attack.t1685
# Description: Detects the use of PowerShell with Uninstall-WindowsFeature or Remove-WindowsFeature cmdlets to disable or remove the Windows Defender GUI feature, a common technique used by adversaries to evade defenses.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* eventtype=wineventlog ((process_exec="*Windows-Defender*") AND ((process_exec="*Uninstall-WindowsFeature*" OR process_exec="*Remove-WindowsFeature*")) AND (((process_path="*\\powershell_ise.exe" OR process_path="*\\powershell.exe" OR process_path="*\\pwsh.exe")) OR ((process_name="PowerShell_ISE.EXE" OR process_name="PowerShell.EXE" OR process_name="pwsh.dll"))))
